# HARC CI5 study context

When the user asks about **CI5**, the **Fifth Channeling Intensive**, **HARC CI5**, or the Nov 2023 Q’uo sessions on will, desire, personality, magic, stewardship, memory, or truth from that intensive:

1. Read `docs/ci5/README.md` for the session index.
2. Read the relevant transcript(s) under `docs/ci5/sessions/` (001–009) before answering.
3. Answer from those transcripts; cite session number/title when useful.
4. Prefer the sessions’ own distinctions (e.g. desire vs will in 006) over inventing synthesis unless the user asks for synthesis.

If the question spans the whole intensive, skim the README foci first, then open the matching session files.

